{
  "_comment": [
    "ATS board tokens for the Tier A public APIs. Edit freely - this file is",
    "the knob you turn to change coverage, and nothing else needs touching.",
    "",
    "  ats       greenhouse | lever | ashby",
    "  token     board token / company slug in the ATS URL, NOT the display name",
    "  target    true = eligible for tier 1 (interrupting push) when score >= 75",
    "  verified  true = this token returned real jobs from a live probe",
    "",
    "Verified against live boards on 2026-08-05 via `jobpipe verify-companies`.",
    "Of 89 seeded tokens, 54 worked as guessed, 14 more were recovered by",
    "probing slug and vendor variants (Cohere/Snowflake/Notion/Confluent moved",
    "to Ashby; DoorDash is 'doordashusa'; Cursor is 'cursor', not 'anysphere'),",
    "and 18 were removed as unreachable - a dead token costs a request every",
    "run forever and can never return data.",
    "",
    "Re-run `jobpipe verify-companies` periodically; companies migrate vendors.",
    "Entries with verified:false are reachable but currently list no jobs.",
    "",
    "Removed as unreachable, worth revisiting by hand if you want coverage:",
    "  Applied Intuition, Atlassian, Citadel, Cruise, dbt Labs, Grammarly,",
    "  HashiCorp, Hudson River Trading, Hugging Face, Netflix, Replicate,",
    "  Retool, Rippling, Rivian, Sourcegraph, Two Sigma, Unity, Weights & Biases",
    "",
    "Endpoints:",
    "  greenhouse  https://boards-api.greenhouse.io/v1/boards/{token}/jobs?content=true",
    "  lever       https://api.lever.co/v0/postings/{token}?mode=json",
    "  ashby       https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/{token}"
  ],
